# The hand-made room (v0.0.17, M116): a level whose geometry and markers come
# from a .blend edited in Blender (Apps/Samples/HelloAtom/Source/hello_room.blend,
# exported by Tools/Blender/export_scene.py). Started with
# ATOM_START_LEVEL=hello_room (its CMakeLists sets it): the player arrives at
# the spawn marker, the marker-placed entities are there, and the floor holds.
expect_level hello_room
expect_near 0 0 3.5 0.3
wait 0.5
expect_stat draws >= 3
expect_animating cube
set inspect lantern
expect_stat inspect_found == 1
teleport 0 0 0 0
wait 0.5
expect_near 0 0 0 0.3
log hello room done
